<title>USA: Raytheon signs $11.4 mln pact with Kuwait.</title>
<headline>Raytheon signs $11.4 mln pact with Kuwait.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raytheon said on Friday it signed a contract worth $11.4 million with the Kuwaiti Ministry of Defense to construct a depot and two Patriot Missile sites in Kuwait.</p>
<p>Raytheon said the construction would take place over 18 months and both the depot and the firing sites would be completed in time for the deployment of the Patriot Missile system in Kuwait.</p>
</text>
